This project provides a patch for KDE kio-extras.

The modified KDE source files retain their original KDE copyright
and licensing terms. See the SPDX license identifiers and copyright
notices in the corresponding KDE source files.

This repository does not redistribute the complete kio-extras source
tree. It distributes only the patch and documentation required to
apply the modification to kio-extras 26.04.0.

The patch itself is provided under the same licensing terms applicable
to the corresponding modified KDE source files, where applicable.
